{"items":[{"str":"citizens because they could not discipline, control, and sublimate their","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,649],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"sexuality.)","dir":"ltr","width":44,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,635],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"This is a very pessimistic view. Another dimension of the social I","dir":"ltr","width":300,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,168,621],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"would like to explore is how people, in turn, resist their management","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,607],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"by technologies of power-knowledge. One way might be through a","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,593],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"cultural studies approach. As Stuart Hall says, there is something at","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,579],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"stake in cultural studies (“Cultural Studies,” 278)—and perhaps what","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,565],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"is at stake is human liberation from the various ways we are managed,","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,551],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"controlled, surveilled, that is, the ways we are interpellated by","dir":"ltr","width":281,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,537],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,437,537],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"ideol-","dir":"ltr","width":27,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,441,537],"fontName":"g_d2896_f1","hasEOL":true},{"str":"ogy","dir":"ltr","width":17,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,523],"fontName":"g_d2896_f1","hasEOL":false},{"str":". A kind of liberation can be at least partially achieved through a","dir":"ltr","width":295,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,173,523],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"critical analysis of our culture and the ways different domains of life in-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,509],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"terconnect, through the production and practice of critical knowl-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,495],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"edge. This means questioning our own assumptions every bit as much","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,481],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"as we question the assumptions of others and of the cultural objects","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,467],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"we examine and analyze. Hall argues that one of the goals of cultural","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,453],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"studies is the formation of the organic intellectual (a term that comes","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,439],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"from Gramsci) and the development of intellectual and theoretical","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,425],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"work as a political practice (281).","dir":"ltr","width":148,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,411],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,304,411],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"15","dir":"ltr","width":8,"height":7,"transform":[7,0,0,7,304,414],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"After Hall presented his paper, a conference attendee asked him","dir":"ltr","width":300,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,168,397],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"whether he was proposing an elite model of learning, where people","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,383],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"are divided into a class of intellectuals who do the analyzing, on the","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,369],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"one hand, and the rest of us, on the other (290). But cultural stud-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,355],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"ies attempts to work against this model of an elite class of educated","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,341],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"people that holds knowledge and rules the world with the extra","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,327],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"knowledge it has. The idea, then, would be to develop a kind of","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,313],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"knowledge and critical practice that all could share. This is why, as","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,299],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"hooks and Wallace point out, popular culture is so useful.","dir":"ltr","width":270,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,285],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,426,285],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"16","dir":"ltr","width":8,"height":7,"transform":[7,0,0,7,426,288],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[7,0,0,7,434,288],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"Every-","dir":"ltr","width":29,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,439,285],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"one already does share it as an arena of cultural contestation and dis-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,271],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"cussion. Recent political debates in the United States and debates","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,257],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"about censorship and public funding for so-called obscene art have","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,243],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"centered around artifacts of popular culture: debates on important","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,229],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"social issues have arisen as a result of Madonna, the rap group 2 Live","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,215],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"Crew, Spike Lee, Sistah Souljah,","dir":"ltr","width":148,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,201],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,304,201],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"Murphy Brown","dir":"ltr","width":66,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,308,201],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":", Ice-T, gangsta rap.","dir":"ltr","width":93,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,375,201],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"These popular culture texts have been at the center of nationwide","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,187],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"critical debates about sexuality, motherhood, racism, homophobia,","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,173],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"freedom of speech, pornography, cultural differences, and multicul-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,159],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"turalism.","dir":"ltr","width":39,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,145],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[9,0,0,9,216,677],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":true},{"str":"Cultural Studies, Popular Culture, and Pedagogy","dir":"ltr","width":191,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,216,677],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":"","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[9,0,0,9,299,117],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"| 20 |","dir":"ltr","width":26,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,299,117],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false}],"styles":{"g_d2896_f2":{"fontFamily":"serif","ascent":0.722,"descent":-0.246,"vertical":false},"g_d2896_f1":{"fontFamily":"serif","ascent":0.72,"descent":-0.245,"vertical":false},"g_d2896_f3":{"fontFamily":"serif","ascent":0.722,"descent":-0.246,"vertical":false}},"lang":null}